usage:
Optional Extension configuration:
{"time":"[time:%H:%M;Europe/Brussels]","speed":1.0,"respawn_on_paddle":true,"respawn_ms":1000,"paddle_accuracy":96,"brick_color":"#F81858"}

The time binding supplies the four hour-and-minute digits and supports timezone parameters. With the default respawn_on_paddle=true, hit clock bricks return together when the ball next hits the paddle; a 30-second safety timeout applies. Set it to false to use respawn_ms (default 1000) instead. speed accepts 0.25 to 4.0. paddle_accuracy accepts 0 to 100; the default is near-perfect. The game field uses the owning button's background color. brick_color accepts a six-digit RGB color.
